# OksaSDR tour, "On the air" continued: RTTY or PSK, iPad landscape 1366x1024.
# Filled by hand or by the spot watcher (the mode, its setup lines, the note). Receive only.
pin 5
record 15
caption !speed 3
caption # On the air
caption {DIGI_MODE}: the Digi section decodes it as text.
ready
wait 4000
caption !speed 1
taptext Digi ~1324,141
taptext View ~1324,82
{DIGI_SETUP}
span 6
wait 3000
caption Autotune finds the signal and locks the decoder on it.
taptext Autotune
wait 4000
caption {DIGI_NOTE}
wait 30000
taptext View ~1324,82
taptext Digi ~1324,141
caption -
record off
freq 14.074
mode DIGU
wait 2000
slices
